  "published": "2026-09-26T01:26:32.96Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 5.0.0 (breaking; add a migration). Outbox rows carry a handler name, partition key and failure time, and ApplyCqrsOutbox() maps the CqrsInboxRecords table; the idempotency table stores the result and a payload fingerprint. On SQL Server, map the idempotency key with IdempotencyEntityConfiguration.SqlServerBinaryCollation.\n            New: EfCoreUnitOfWork<TContext> and hosted retention services. Each target framework builds against its own EF Core major (8, 9, 10). The store classes are internal; register them through the store verbs.\n            See https://github.com/BisocM/CQRSharp/blob/v5.0.0/CHANGELOG.md for the full notes and the upgrade steps from 4.2.1.",
